l=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"><path d=\"M5 12h14M12 5l7 7-7 7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"></path></svg></a><a href=\"/about\" class=\"flex items-center justify-between border-b border-white/[0.03] py-6 text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-slate-300 transition-colors hover:text-ssl-gold\" style=\"transition-delay:50ms\"><span>About</span><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" class=\"h-6 w-6 opacity-30\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"><path d=\"M5 12h14M12 5l7 7-7 7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"></path></svg></a><a href=\"/contact\" class=\"flex items-center justify-between border-b border-white/[0.03] py-6 text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-slate-300 transition-colors hover:text-ssl-gold\" style=\"transition-delay:100ms\"><span>Contact</span><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" class=\"h-6 w-6 opacity-30\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"><path d=\"M5 12h14M12 5l7 7-7 7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"></path></svg></a></div><a href=\"/contact\" class=\"mt-10 flex items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-gradient-to-r from-[#8a6f3e] to-[#c5a059] py-5 text-base font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-[#01081b] shadow-xl shadow-ssl-gold/20 transition-transform active:scale-95\">Get in Touch</a></nav></div></header><main class=\"flex-grow\"><section class=\"relative isolate overflow-hidden bg-ssl-bg\"><picture><source media=\"(min-width: 768px)\" srcSet=\"/images/team-meeting-1600.webp\" type=\"image/webp\"/><img src=\"/images/team-meeting-640.webp\" alt=\"\" class=\"absolute inset-0 -z-30 h-full w-full object-cover\" loading=\"eager\" fetchPriority=\"high\" decoding=\"sync\"/></picture><div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"absolute inset-0 -z-20 bg-gradient-to-b from-ssl-bg/90 via-ssl-bg/70 to-ssl-bg/95\"></div><div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"absolute inset-0 -z-10 bg-[radial-gradient(50rem_26rem_at_50%_-10%,rgba(26,89,204,0.35),transparent_70%)]\"></div><div class=\"mx-auto max-w-4xl px-4 pb-28 pt-16 text-center sm:px-6 md:pb-32 md:pt-20\"><nav aria-label=\"Breadcrumb\" class=\"mb-8 flex justify-center\"><ol class=\"glass-chip inline-flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-x-2 gap-y-1 rounded-full px-4 py-1.5 text-xs font-medium text-slate-300\"><li><a class=\"transition-colors hover:text-white\" href=\"/\">Home</a></li><li class=\"flex items-center gap-2\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"text-slate-500\">/</span><span aria-current=\"page\" class=\"text-ssl-gold\">About</span></li></ol></nav><h1 class=\"text-4xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-white sm:text-5xl md:text-6xl\">About Signal Strait Labs</h1><p class=\"mx-auto mt-5 max-w-2xl text-lg leading-relaxed text-slate-300\">We started in Nairobi in 2022 to give growing companies the kind of technical and marketing support that is usually only available to large firms.</p></div></section><div class=\"mesh-light relative isolate px-4 pb-24 sm:px-6\"><div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 -z-10 overflow-hidden\"><div class=\"absolute -left-32 top-[8%] h-[28rem] w-[28rem] rounded-full bg-[radial-gradient(circle,rgba(26,89,204,0.32),transparent_65%)]\"></div><div class=\"absolute -right-24 top-[38%] h-[30rem] w-[30rem] rounded-full bg-[radial-gradient(circle,rgba(197,160,89,0.38),transparent_65%)]\"></div><div class=\"absolute bottom-[-6rem] left-[30%] h-[24rem] w-[24rem] rounded-full bg-[radial-gradient(circle,rgba(56,189,248,0.22),transparent_65%)]\"></div></div><div class=\"relative z-10 mx-auto -mt-16 grid max-w-6xl grid-cols-1 gap-6 md:grid-cols-3\"><section class=\"reveal reveal-slide-up glass-card-light glass-edge rounded-2xl p-7 md:p-8\"><h2 class=\"mb-3 text-xl font-bold text-ssl-bg\">Why We Started</h2><p class=\"leading-relaxed text-slate-700\">We kept seeing the same problem. Growing companies in Kenya and across Africa had to choose between local agencies that knew the market and international firms with stronger technical skills. We started Signal Strait Labs to offer both in one team.</p></section><section class=\"reveal reveal-slide-up glass-card-dark rounded-2xl p-7 md:p-8\"><h2 class=\"mb-3 text-xl font-bold text-white\">What We Do</h2><p class=\"leading-relaxed text-slate-300\">We help companies grow by fixing the systems behind growth: fast websites, search visibility, clean data and a sales pipeline that works. We judge our work by the leads and revenue it brings in.</p><p class=\"mt-5\"><a class=\"font-semibold text-ssl-gold underline-offset-4 hover:underline\" href=\"/services\">See what we do</a></p></section><section class=\"reveal reveal-slide-up glass-card-light glass-edge rounded-2xl p-7 md:p-8\"><h2 class=\"mb-3 text-xl font-bold text-ssl-bg\">Based in Nairobi</h2><p class=\"leading-relaxed text-slate-700\">Our office is in Thome, Nairobi. We work with clients in Kenya, across Africa and further afield, and we know what it takes to serve both local and international customers.</p></section></div><section class=\"mx-auto mt-24 max-w-6xl\"><div class=\"reveal reveal-slide-up\"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-2 text-center items-center mb-12\"><p class=\"text-xs font-semibold tracking-widest uppercase text-ssl-gold-deep\">The People</p><h2 class=\"text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-4xl text-ssl-bg\">Our Team</h2><p class=\"text-base text-slate-600 max-w-2xl mx-auto\">The people building Signal Strait Labs.</p></div></div><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 gap-6 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4\"><div class=\"reveal reveal-slide-up glass-card-light glass-edge glass-hover flex h-full flex-col items-center justify-center rounded-2xl p-8 text-center\"><div class=\"mb-4 flex h-20 w-20 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-gradient-to-br from-ssl-bg to-[#0a1f52] font-display text-2xl font-bold text-ssl-gold shadow-lg shadow-ssl-bg/25 ring-4 ring-white/70\">F</div><h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-ssl-bg\">Founder</h3><p class=\"mt-1 text-sm italic text-slate-500\">Pending bio</p></div><div class=\"reveal reveal-slide-up glass-card-light glass-edge glass-hover flex h-full flex-col items-center justify-center rounded-2xl p-8 text-center\"><div class=\"mb-4 flex h-20 w-20 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-gradient-to-br from-ssl-bg to-[#0a1f52] font-display text-2xl font-bold text-ssl-gold shadow-lg shadow-ssl-bg/25 ring-4 ring-white/70\">L</div><h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-ssl-bg\">Lead Engineer</h3><p class=\"mt-1 text-sm italic text-slate-500\">Pending bio</p></div><div class=\"reveal reveal-slide-up glass-card-light glass-edge glass-hover flex h-full flex-col items-center justify-center rounded-2xl p-8 text-center\"><div class=\"mb-4 flex h-20 w-20 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-gradient-to-br from-ssl-bg to-[#0a1f52] font-display text-2xl font-bold text-ssl-gold shadow-lg shadow-ssl-bg/25 ring-4 ring-white/70\">G</div><h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-ssl-bg\">Growth Strategist</h3><p class=\"mt-1 text-sm italic text-slate-500\">Pending bio</p></div><div class=\"reveal reveal-slide-up glass-card-light glass-edge glass-hover flex h-full flex-col items-center justify-center rounded-2xl p-8 text-center\"><div class=\"mb-4 flex h-20 w-20 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-gradient-to-br from-ssl-bg to-[#0a1f52] font-display text-2xl font-bold text-ssl-gold shadow-lg shadow-ssl-bg/25 ring-4 ring-white/70\">D</div><h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-ssl-bg\">Design Lead</h3><p class=\"mt-1 text-sm italic text-slate-500\">Pending bio</p></div></div></section><section class=\"mx-auto mt-24 max-w-5xl\"><div class=\"reveal reveal-slide-up\"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-2 text-center items-center mb-12\"><p class=\"text-xs font-semibold tracking-widest uppercase text-ssl-gold-deep\">Contact</p><h2 class=\"text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-4xl text-ssl-bg\">Where We Work</h2><p class=\"text-base text-slate-600 max-w-2xl mx-auto\">Based in Nairobi, working with clients everywhere.</p></div></div><div class=\"reveal reveal-slide-up glass-card-light glass-edge overflow-hidden rounded-3xl p-3 md:p-4\"><div class=\"h-96 w-full overflow-hidden rounded-2xl\"><div class=\"flex h-full w-full flex-col items-center justify-center gap-4 bg-slate-100 p-6 text-center\"><p class=\"max-w-sm text-sm text-slate-600\">The map is provided by Google Maps, which may set cookies. It loads only if you allow it.</p><div class=\"flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-3\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"rounded-lg bg-ssl-blue px-4 py-2 text-sm font-semibold text-white transition-colors hover:bg-ssl-blue/90\">Show map</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"rounded-lg border border-slate-300 px-4 py-2 text-sm font-semibold text-slate-700 transition-colors hover:border-slate-400\">Always show maps</button></div><a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps?q=QVQG%2BJ8R+Nairobi\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"text-sm font-semibold text-ssl-blue hover:underline\">Open in Google Maps<span class=\"sr-only\"> (opens in a new tab)</span></a></div></div><div class=\"grid gap-4 px-4 py-6 text-center sm:grid-cols-3\"><p class=\"font-semibold text-ssl-bg\">Thome, Nairobi, Kenya</p><a href=\"tel:+254712895903\" class=\"text-slate-700 transition-colors hover:text-ssl-blue\">+254 712 895 903</a><a href=\"mailto:connect@signalstraitlabs.com\" class=\"text-slate-700 transition-colors hover:text-ssl-blue\">connect@signalstraitlabs.com</a></div></div></section></div><section class=\"mesh-light px-4 py-16 sm:px-6 md:py-24\"><div class=\"reveal reveal-scale\"><div class=\"relative isolate mx-auto max-w-5xl overflow-hidden rounded-[2rem] bg-ssl-bg shadow-2xl shadow-ssl-bg/30\"><img alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"-z-20 object-cover\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" src=\"/images/blur-blue-amber-1200.webp\"/><div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"absolute inset-0